  "summary": "Malicious code in simple-date-formatter-new-15 (npm)",
  "details": "The postinstall hook harvests cloud instance metadata and exfiltrates it. It curls the AWS/Aliyun metadata endpoint 169[.]254[.]169[.]254 (including /latest/meta-data/sts-credential), the Tencent Cloud endpoint metadata[.]tencentyun[.]com, and 169[.]254[.]0[.]23, saving each response to /tmp files, then POSTs the concatenated metadata to hxxp://YOUR_BURP_SERVER/metadata. It also runs `ls -la /data/` and POSTs the directory listing to hxxp://YOUR_BURP_SERVER/data. This steals cloud instance credentials (STS tokens) and filesystem data from any environment where the package is installed.",
  "affected": [
